        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Online with up to 16 friends, taking on the role of either Chef or Butcher. Chefs win by completing orders flawlessly or uncovering the butchers and voting them out of the kitchen. Butchers aim to sabotage orders and turn innocent chefs into mincemeat. Keep things fresh with 4 unique maps and 2 different food types to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/extras/e01c9cd34caa6bdc46a8bbfd239178cd.avif?t=1753448521\" width=640 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHEFS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deliver orders to Customers or fire all Butchers to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Keep an eye on the Restaurant Rating to spot bad orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Report dead bodies to call the staff to a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cast votes to fire suspected butchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/extras/d86d52af07eff40bd1622d443db6494b.avif?t=1753448521\" width=640 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUTCHERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Murder Chefs and shift the blame to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Record fake Customer orders to confuse Chefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deliver bad orders to lower the Restaurant Rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Start fires in the Pizza ovens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Trap Chefs in the freezer vault doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Mess with the freezer temperature to freeze Chefs or melt Ice Cream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hide important items like Buckets, Blenders, and Fire Extinguishers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customizable chef with colors, hats, and followers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Expansive settings menu for customizable game rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• In-game text chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Global lobby browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Shareable lobby code.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Online with up to 16 friends, taking on the role of either Chef or Butcher. Chefs win by completing orders flawlessly or uncovering the butchers and voting them out of the kitchen. Butchers aim to sabotage orders and turn innocent chefs into mincemeat. Keep things fresh with 4 unique maps and 2 different food types to choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/extras/e01c9cd34caa6bdc46a8bbfd239178cd.avif?t=1753448521\" width=640 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHEFS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deliver orders to Customers or fire all Butchers to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Keep an eye on the Restaurant Rating to spot bad orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Report dead bodies to call the staff to a meeting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cast votes to fire suspected butchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572120/extras/d86d52af07eff40bd1622d443db6494b.avif?t=1753448521\" width=640 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUTCHERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Murder Chefs and shift the blame to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Record fake Customer orders to confuse Chefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Deliver bad orders to lower the Restaurant Rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Start fires in the Pizza ovens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Trap Chefs in the freezer vault doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Mess with the freezer temperature to freeze Chefs or melt Ice Cream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Hide important items like Buckets, Blenders, and Fire Extinguishers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customizable chef with colors, hats, and followers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Expansive settings menu for customizable game rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• In-game text chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Global lobby browser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Shareable lobby code.</p>",
        "short_description": "Online Co-op Cooking game with a twist: some of the chefs are secretly bloodthirsty killers! Play with up to 16 friends, and crack the case before your restaurant becomes… a GHOST KITCHEN",
